                                                "sense_id": "f3a890b9-6267-3c36-910c-6c179fa5bea3",
                                                "text": "Customers are usually enticed in with a \"ducat\", or pass for one free dance; after that it costs them ten cents a time. I can work out expensively, particularly with the heightened tempo of war."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15a8d18e-32a5-48d9-9529-98e8875541a9",
                                                "sense_id": "f3a890b9-6267-3c36-910c-6c179fa5bea3",
                                                "text": "The room was expensively furnished."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
